Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: xwayland-satellite
Upstream-Contact: Shawn Wallace
Source: https://github.com/Supreeeme/xwayland-satellite/archive/refs/tags/v0.8.2.tar.gz
Comment:
 Built by Lulo OS from upstream tag v0.8.2, commit
 8d135d3b2854b30fd01ea6cd6c27e523dd50a839, without modification. The
 complete corresponding source is the xwayland-satellite_0.8.2+lulo1
 source package (xwayland-satellite_0.8.2+lulo1.dsc and the tarballs it
 names) attached to the same GitHub Release as this binary package.
 .
 The binary statically links the Rust crates in vendor/ and embeds
 OpenSans-Regular.ttf for window decorations. Every vendored crate's
 declared licence and its licence and notice files are reproduced in
 /usr/share/doc/xwayland-satellite/LICENSE.dependencies.

